WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Say it with feeling.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
V.O.I.C.E. can say a message in a feeling.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.600
Happy, excited, silly, question,
calm, sad, mad or scared.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.200
Each feeling always sits in the
same place on a ring.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Press and hold the message bar
for half a second.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.400
The ring of eight feelings opens,
with “Normal” in the center.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.400
Slide to a feeling and let go

8
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.600
to say the message once in that tone.

9
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.600
Rest on a feeling for one second

10
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.600
and it becomes the learner’s mood, so every message
sounds that way until it is changed.

11
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.600
A quick tap on the message bar just says it.

12
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.600
A feeling changes the pitch, the speed
and the ending punctuation.

13
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.800
It uses the iPad’s own voice, so Enhanced or
Premium voices show it best.

14
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
